e'>{}</span>", "ja527:65.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja527:65.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja527:66.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja527:66.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja527:66.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja527:66.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja527:67.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja527:67.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja527:67.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja527:67.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja527:68.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja527:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja527:0.2": "Paṇṇāsanipāta ", "ja527:0.3": "Niḷinikāvagga ", "ja527:0.4": "2 Ummādantījātaka ", "ja527:1.1": "“Nivesanaṁ kassa nudaṁ sunanda, ", "ja527:1.2": "Pākārena paṇḍumayena guttaṁ; ", "ja527:1.3": "Kā dissati aggisikhāva dūre, ", "ja527:1.4": "Vehāyasaṁ pabbataggeva acci. ", "ja527:2.1": "Dhītā nvayaṁ kassa sunanda hoti, ", "ja527:2.2": "Suṇisā nvayaṁ kassa athopi bhariyā; ", "ja527:2.3": "Akkhāhi me khippamidheva puṭṭho, ", "ja527:2.4": "Avāvaṭā yadi vā atthi bhattā”. ", "ja527:3.1": "“Ahañhi jānāmi janinda etaṁ, ", "ja527:3.2": "Matyā ca petyā ca athopi assā; ", "ja527:3.3": "Taveva so puriso bhūmipāla, ", "ja527:3.4": "Rattindivaṁ appamatto tavatthe. ", "ja527:4.1": "Iddho ca phīto ca suvaḍḍhito ca, ", "ja527:4.2": "Amacco ca te aññataro janinda; ", "ja527:4.3": "Tassesā bhariyābhipārakassa, ", "ja527:4.4": "Ummādantī nāmadheyyena rāja”. ", "ja527:5.1": "“Ambho ambho nāmamidaṁ imissā, ", "ja527:5.2": "Matyā ca petyā ca kataṁ susādhu; ", "ja527:5.3": "Tadā hi mayhaṁ avalokayantī, ", "ja527:5.4": "Ummattakaṁ ummadantī akāsi. ", "ja527:6.1": "Yā puṇṇamāse migamandalocanā, ", "ja527:6.2": "Upāvisi puṇḍarīkattacaṅgī; ", "ja527:6.3": "Dve puṇṇamāyo tadahū amaññahaṁ, ", "ja527:6.4": "Disvāna pārāvatarattavāsiniṁ. ", "ja527:7.1": "Aḷārapamhehi subhehi vaggubhi, ", "ja527:7.2": "Palobhayantī maṁ yadā udikkhati; ", "ja527:7.3": "Vijambhamānā harateva me mano, ", "ja527:7.4": "Jātā vane kimpurisīva pabbate. ", "ja527:8.1": "Tadā hi brahatī sāmā, ", "ja527:8.2": "āmuttamaṇikuṇḍalā; ", "ja527:8.3": "Ekaccavasanā nārī, ", "ja527:8.4": "migī bhantāvudikkhati. ", "ja527:9.1": "Kadāssu maṁ tambanakhā sulomā, ", "ja527:9.2": "Bāhāmudū candanasāralittā; ", "ja527:9.3": "Vaṭṭaṅgulī sannatadhīrakuttiyā, ", "ja527:9.4": "Nārī upaññissati sīsato subhā. ", "ja527:10.1": "Kadāssu maṁ kañcanajāluracchadā, ", "ja527:10.2": "Dhītā tirīṭissa vilaggamajjhā; ", "ja527:10.3": "Mudūhi bāhāhi palissajissati, ", "ja527:10.4": "Brahāvane jātadumaṁva māluvā. ", "ja527:11.1": "Kadāssu lākhārasarattasucchavī, ", "ja527:11.2": "Bindutthanī puṇḍarīkattacaṅgī; ", "ja527:11.3": "Mukhaṁ mukhena upanāmayissati, ", "ja527:11.4": "Soṇḍova soṇḍassa surāya thālaṁ. ", "ja527:12.1": "Yadāddasaṁ taṁ tiṭṭhantiṁ, ", "ja527:12.2": "Sabbabhaddaṁ manoramaṁ; ", "ja527:12.3": "Tato sakassa cittassa, ", "ja527:12.4": "Nāvabodhāmi kañcinaṁ. ", "ja527:13.1": "Ummādantimahaṁ daṭṭhā, ", "ja527:13.2": "āmuttamaṇikuṇḍalaṁ; ", "ja527:13.3": "Na supāmi divārattiṁ, ", "ja527:13.4": "sahassaṁva parājito. ", "ja527:14.1": "Sakko ce me varaṁ dajjā, ", "ja527:14.2": "so ca labbhetha me varo; ", "ja527:14.3": "Ekarattaṁ dvirattaṁ vā, ", "ja527:14.4": "bhaveyyaṁ abhipārako; ", "ja527:14.5": "Ummādantyā ramitvāna, ", "ja527:14.6": "sivirājā tato siyaṁ”. ", "ja527:15.1": "“Bhūtāni me bhūtapatī namassato, ", "ja527:15.2": "Āgamma yakkho idametadabravi; ", "ja527:15.3": "Rañño mano ummadantyā niviṭṭho, ", "ja527:15.4": "Dadāmi te taṁ paricārayassu”. ", "ja527:16.1": "“Puññā ca dhaṁse amaro na camhi, ", "ja527:16.2": "Jano ca me pāpamidañca jaññā; ", "ja527:16.3": "Bhuso ca tyassa manaso vighāto, ", "ja527:16.4": "Datvā piyaṁ ummadantiṁ adaṭṭhā”. ", "ja527:17.1": "“Janinda nāññatra tayā mayā vā, ", "ja527:17.2": "Sabbāpi kammassa katassa jaññā; ", "ja527:17.3": "Yaṁ te mayā ummadantī padinnā, ", "ja527:17.4": "Bhusehi rājā vanathaṁ sajāhi”. ", "ja527:18.1": "“Yo pāpakaṁ kamma karaṁ manusso, ", "ja527:18.2": "So maññati māyida maññiṁsu aññe; ", "ja527:18.3": "Passanti bhūtāni karontametaṁ, ", "ja527:18.4": "Yuttā ca ye honti narā pathabyā. ", "ja527:19.1": "Añño nu te koci naro pathabyā, ", "ja527:19.2": "Saddheyya lokasmi na me piyāti; ", "ja527:19.3": "Bhuso ca tyassa manaso vighāto, ", "ja527:19.4": "Datvā piyaṁ ummadantiṁ adaṭṭhā”. ", "ja527:20.1": "“Addhā piyā mayha janinda esā, ", "ja527:20.2": "Na sā mamaṁ appiyā bhūmipāla; ", "ja527:20.3": "Gaccheva tvaṁ ummadantiṁ bhadante, ", "ja527:20.4": "Sīhova selassa guhaṁ upeti”. ", "ja527:21.1": "“Na pīḷitā attadukhena dhīrā, ", "ja527:21.2": "Sukhapphalaṁ kamma pariccajanti; ", "ja527:21.3": "Sammohitā vāpi sukhena mattā, ", "ja527:21.4": "Na pāpakammañca samācaranti”. ", "ja527:22.1": "“Tuvañhi mātā ca pitā ca mayhaṁ, ", "ja527:22.2": "Bhattā patī posako devatā ca; ", "ja527:22.3": "Dāso ahaṁ tuyha saputtadāro, ", "ja527:22.4": "Yathāsukhaṁ sāmi karohi kāmaṁ”. ", "ja527:23.1": "“Yo issaromhīti karoti pāpaṁ, ", "ja527:23.2": "Katvā ca so nuttasate paresaṁ; ", "ja527:23.3": "Na tena so jīvati dīghamāyu, ", "ja527:23.4": "Devāpi pāpena samekkhare naṁ. ", "ja527:24.1": "Aññātakaṁ sāmikehī padinnaṁ, ", "ja527:24.2": "Dhamme ṭhitā ye paṭicchanti dānaṁ; ", "ja527:24.3": "Paṭicchakā dāyakā cāpi tattha, ", "ja527:24.4": "Sukhapphalaññeva karonti kammaṁ. ", "ja527:25.1": "Añño nu te koci naro pathabyā, ", "ja527:25.2": "Saddheyya lokasmi na me piyāti; ", "ja527:25.3": "Bhuso ca tyassa manaso vighāto, ", "ja527:25.4": "Datvā piyaṁ ummadantiṁ adaṭṭhā”. ", "ja527:26.1": "“Addhā piyā mayha janinda esā, ", "ja527:26.2": "Na sā mamaṁ appiyā bhūmipāla; ", "ja527:26.3": "Yaṁ te mayā ummadantī padinnā, ", "ja527:26.4": "Bhusehi rājā vanathaṁ sajāhi”. ", "ja527:27.1": "“Yo attadukkhena parassa dukkhaṁ, ", "ja527:27.2": "Sukhena vā attasukhaṁ dahāti; ", "ja527:27.3": "Yathevidaṁ mayha tathā paresaṁ, ", "ja527:27.4": "Yo evaṁ jānāti sa vedi dhammaṁ. ", "ja527:28.1": "Añño nu te koci naro pathabyā, ", "ja527:28.2": "Saddheyya lokasmi na me piyāti; ", "ja527:28.3": "Bhuso ca tyassa manaso vighāto, ", "ja527:28.4": "Datvā piyaṁ ummadantiṁ adaṭṭhā”. ", "ja527:29.1": "“Janinda jānāsi piyā mamesā, ", "ja527:29.2": "Na sā mamaṁ appiyā bhūmipāla; ", "ja527:29.3": "Piyena te dammi piyaṁ janinda, ", "ja527:29.4": "Piyadāyino deva piyaṁ labhanti”. ", "ja527:30.1": "“So nūnāhaṁ vadhissāmi, ", "ja527:30.2": "attānaṁ kāmahetukaṁ; ", "ja527:30.3": "Na hi dhammaṁ adhammena, ", "ja527:30.4": "ahaṁ vadhitumussahe”. ", "ja527:31.1": "“Sace tuvaṁ mayha satiṁ janinda, ", "ja527:31.2": "Na kāmayāsi naravīra seṭṭha; ", "ja527:31.3": "Cajāmi naṁ sabbajanassa sibyā, ", "ja527:31.4": "Mayā pamuttaṁ tato avhayesi naṁ”. ", "ja527:32.1": "“Adūsiyañce abhipāraka tvaṁ, ", "ja527:32.2": "Cajāsi katte ahitāya tyassa; ", "ja527:32.3": "Mahā ca te upavādopi assa, ", "ja527:32.4": "Na cāpi tyassa nagaramhi pakkho”. ", "ja527:33.1": "“Ahaṁ sahissaṁ upavādametaṁ, ", "ja527:33.2": "Nindaṁ pasaṁsaṁ garahañca sabbaṁ; ", "ja527:33.3": "Mametamāgacchatu bhūmipāla, ", "ja527:33.4": "Yathāsukhaṁ sivi karohi kāmaṁ”. ", "ja527:34.1": "“Yo neva nindaṁ na panappasaṁsaṁ, ", "ja527:34.2": "Ādiyati garahaṁ nopi pūjaṁ; ", "ja527:34.3": "Sirī ca lakkhī ca apeti tamhā, ", "ja527:34.4": "Āpo suvuṭṭhīva yathā thalamhā”. ", "ja527:35.1": "“Yaṁ kiñci dukkhañca sukhañca etto, ", "ja527:35.2": "Dhammātisārañca manovighātaṁ; ", "ja527:35.3": "Urasā ahaṁ paccuttarissāmi sabbaṁ, ", "ja527:35.4": "Pathavī yathā thāvarānaṁ tasānaṁ”. ", "ja527:36.1": "“Dhammātisārañca manovighātaṁ, ", "ja527:36.2": "Dukkhañca nicchāmi ahaṁ paresaṁ; ", "ja527:36.3": "Ekovimaṁ hārayissāmi bhāraṁ, ", "ja527:36.4": "Dhamme ṭhito kiñci ahāpayanto”. ", "ja527:37.1": "“Saggūpagaṁ puññakammaṁ janinda, ", "ja527:37.2": "Mā me tuvaṁ antarāyaṁ akāsi; ", "ja527:37.3": "Dadāmi te ummadantiṁ pasanno, ", "ja527:37.4": "Rājāva yaññe dhanaṁ brāhmaṇānaṁ”. ", "ja527:38.1": "“Addhā tuvaṁ katte hitesi mayhaṁ, ", "ja527:38.2": "Sakhā mamaṁ ummadantī tuvañca; ", "ja527:38.3": "Nindeyyu devā pitaro ca sabbe, ", "ja527:38.4": "Pāpañca passaṁ abhisamparāyaṁ”. ", "ja527:39.1": "“Na hetadhammaṁ sivirāja vajjuṁ, ", "ja527:39.2": "Sanegamā jānapadā ca sabbe; ", "ja527:39.3": "Yaṁ te mayā ummadantī padinnā, ", "ja527:39.4": "Bhusehi rājā vanathaṁ sajāhi”. ", "ja527:40.1": "“Addhā tuvaṁ katte hitesi mayhaṁ, ", "ja527:40.2": "Sakhā mamaṁ ummadantī tuvañca; ", "ja527:40.3": "Satañca dhammāni sukittitāni, ", "ja527:40.4": "Samuddavelāva duraccayāni”. ", "ja527:41.1": "“Āhuneyyo mesi hitānukampī, ", "ja527:41.2": "Dhātā vidhātā casi kāmapālo; ", "ja527:41.3": "Tayī hutā rāja mahapphalā hi, ", "ja527:41.4": "Kāmena me ummadantiṁ paṭiccha”. ", "ja527:42.1": "“Addhā hi sabbaṁ abhipāraka tvaṁ, ", "ja527:42.2": "Dhammaṁ acārī mama kattuputta; ", "ja527:42.3": "Añño nu te ko idha sotthikattā, ", "ja527:42.4": "Dvipado naro aruṇe jīvaloke”. ", "ja527:43.1": "“Tuvaṁ nu seṭṭho tvamanuttarosi, ", "ja527:43.2": "Tvaṁ dhammagutto dhammavidū sumedho; ", "ja527:43.3": "So dhammagutto cirameva jīva, ", "ja527:43.4": "Dhammañca me desaya dhammapāla”. ", "ja527:44.1": "“Tadiṅgha abhipāraka, ", "ja527:44.2": "suṇohi vacanaṁ mama; ", "ja527:44.3": "Dhammaṁ te desayissāmi, ", "ja527:44.4": "sataṁ āsevitaṁ ahaṁ. ", "ja527:45.1": "Sādhu dhammaruci rājā, ", "ja527:45.2": "sādhu paññāṇavā naro; ", "ja527:45.3": "Sādhu mittānamaddubbho, ", "ja527:45.4": "pāpassākaraṇaṁ sukhaṁ. ", "ja527:46.1": "Akkodhanassa vijite, ", "ja527:46.2": "ṭhitadhammassa rājino; ", "ja527:46.3": "Sukhaṁ manussā āsetha, ", "ja527:46.4": "sītacchāyāya saṅghare. ", "ja527:47.1": "Na cāhametaṁ abhirocayāmi, ", "ja527:47.2": "Kammaṁ asamekkhakataṁ asādhu; ", "ja527:47.3": "Ye vāpi ñatvāna sayaṁ karonti, ", "ja527:47.4": "Upamā imā mayhaṁ tuvaṁ suṇohi. ", "ja527:48.1": "Gavañce taramānānaṁ, ", "ja527:48.2": "jimhaṁ gacchati puṅgavo; ", "ja527:48.3": "Sabbā tā jimhaṁ gacchanti, ", "ja527:48.4": "nette jimhaṁ gate sati. ", "ja527:49.1": "Evameva manussesu, ", "ja527:49.2": "yo hoti seṭṭhasammato; ", "ja527:49.3": "So ce adhammaṁ carati, ", "ja527:49.4": "pageva itarā pajā; ", "ja527:49.5": "Sabbaṁ raṭṭhaṁ dukhaṁ seti, ", "ja527:49.6": "rājā ce hoti adhammiko. ", "ja527:50.1": "Gavañce taramānānaṁ, ", "ja527:50.2": "ujuṁ gacchati puṅgavo; ", "ja527:50.3": "Sabbā gāvī ujuṁ yanti, ", "ja527:50.4": "nette ujuṁ gate sati. ", "ja527:51.1": "Evameva manussesu, ", "ja527:51.2": "yo hoti seṭṭhasammato; ", "ja527:51.3": "So sace dhammaṁ carati, ", "ja527:51.4": "pageva itarā pajā; ", "ja527:51.5": "Sabbaṁ raṭṭhaṁ sukhaṁ seti, ", "ja527:51.6": "rājā ce hoti dhammiko. ", "ja527:52.1": "Na cāpāhaṁ adhammena, ", "ja527:52.2": "amarattamabhipatthaye; ", "ja527:52.3": "Imaṁ vā pathaviṁ sabbaṁ, ", "ja527:52.4": "vijetuṁ abhipāraka. ", "ja527:53.1": "Yañhi kiñci manussesu, ", "ja527:53.2": "ratanaṁ idha vijjati; ", "ja527:53.3": "Gāvo dāso hiraññañca, ", "ja527:53.4": "vatthiyaṁ haricandanaṁ. ", "ja527:54.1": "Assitthiyo ratanaṁ maṇikañca, ", "ja527:54.2": "Yañcāpi me candasūriyā abhipālayanti; ", "ja527:54.3": "Na tassa hetu visamaṁ careyyaṁ, ", "ja527:54.4": "Majjhe sivīnaṁ usabhomhi jāto. ", "ja527:55.1": "Netā hitā uggato raṭṭhapālo, ", "ja527:55.2": "Dhammaṁ sivīnaṁ apacāyamāno; ", "ja527:55.3": "So dhammamevānuvicintayanto, ", "ja527:55.4": "Tasmā sake cittavase na vatto”. ", "ja527:56.1": "“Addhā tuvaṁ mahārāja, ", "ja527:56.2": "niccaṁ abyasanaṁ sivaṁ; ", "ja527:56.3": "Karissasi ciraṁ rajjaṁ, ", "ja527:56.4": "paññā hi tava tādisī. ", "ja527:57.1": "Etaṁ te anumodāma, ", "ja527:57.2": "yaṁ dhammaṁ nappamajjasi; ", "ja527:57.3": "Dhammaṁ pamajja khattiyo, ", "ja527:57.4": "raṭṭhā cavati issaro. ", "ja527:58.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:58.2": "mātāpitūsu khattiya; ", "ja527:58.3": "Idha dhammaṁ caritvāna, ", "ja527:58.4": "rāja saggaṁ gamissasi. ", "ja527:59.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:59.2": "puttadāresu khattiya; ", "ja527:59.3": "…pe… ", "ja527:60.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:60.2": "mittāmaccesu khattiya; ", "ja527:60.3": "…pe… ", "ja527:61.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:61.2": "vāhanesu balesu ca; ", "ja527:61.3": "…pe… ", "ja527:62.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:62.2": "gāmesu nigamesu ca; ", "ja527:62.3": "…pe… ", "ja527:63.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:63.2": "raṭṭhesu janapadesu ca; ", "ja527:63.3": "…pe… ", "ja527:64.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:64.2": "samaṇabrāhmaṇesu ca; ", "ja527:64.3": "…pe… ", "ja527:65.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:65.2": "migapakkhīsu khattiya; ", "ja527:65.3": "…pe… ", "ja527:66.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:66.2": "dhammo ciṇṇo sukhāvaho; ", "ja527:66.3": "Idha dhammaṁ caritvāna, ", "ja527:66.4": "rāja saggaṁ gamissasi. ", "ja527:67.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja527:67.2": "saindā devā sabrahmakā; ", "ja527:67.3": "Suciṇṇena divaṁ pattā, ", "ja527:67.4": "mā dhammaṁ rāja pāmado”ti. ", "ja527:68.1": "Ummādantījātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja527:0.1": "", "ja527:0.2": "", "ja527:0.3": "", "ja527:0.4": "Ummādantī → ummādanti (bj); ummādantīti (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr); ummadantī (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja527:1.1": "", "ja527:1.2": "", "ja527:1.3": "", "ja527:1.4": "Vehāyasaṁ → vehāsayaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja527:2.1": "nvayaṁ → nayaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); nvāyaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja527:2.2": "nvayaṁ → nayaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); nvāyaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja527:2.3": "", "ja527:2.4": "", "ja527:3.1": "", "ja527:3.2": "", "ja527:3.3": "", "ja527:3.4": "", "ja527:4.1": "suvaḍḍhito → subāḷhiko (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja527:4.2": "", "ja527:4.3": "bhariyābhipārakassa → bhariyā ahipārakassa (bj, pts-vp-pli1); bhariyā abhipārakassa (sya1ed, sya2ed); bhariyā abhipādakassa (mr) ", "ja527:4.4": "", "ja527:5.1": "", "ja527:5.2": "", "ja527:5.3": "Tadā → tathā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja527:5.4": "", "ja527:6.1": "puṇṇamāse → puṇṇamāye (mr) ", "ja527:6.2": "", "ja527:6.3": "", "ja527:6.4": "", "ja527:7.1": "", "ja527:7.2": "", "ja527:7.3": "", "ja527:7.4": "", "ja527:8.1": "", "ja527:8.2": "", "ja527: